msgstr "Tokeny Bookshelf"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:191
msgid ""
"Tokens are placeholders that get replaced with live data when the top panel or status line renders.\n"
"\n"
"  %title — %book_pct\n"
"  → Dune — 36%\n"
"\n"
"Wrap content in [if:foo]…[/if] to show it only when the token has a value. Add [else]…[/if] for a fallback.\n"
"\n"
"  [if:series]Book %series_num of %series_name[/if]\n"
"  [if:batt<20]LOW %batt[/if]"
msgstr ""
"Tokeny sú zástupné znaky, ktoré sa pri vykreslení horného panela alebo stavového riadku nahradia aktuálnymi údajmi.\n"
"\n"
"  %title — %book_pct\n"
"  → Dune — 36%\n"
"\n"
"Obsah vložený do [if:foo]…[/if] sa zobrazí iba vtedy, keď má token hodnotu. Pridajte [else]…[/if] pre náhradnú možnosť.\n"
"\n"
"  [if:series]Kniha %series_num zo série %series_name[/if]\n"
"  [if:batt<20]NÍZKA %batt[/if]"

